  "description": "Overlay 6 of 30: close S3-01 through S3-08 by completing portable FULL/REPLACE coverage for the modern Study Plan graph, introducing exact point-in-time snapshot rollback semantics, preventing invalid metadata-only annex persistence, stripping personal/runtime state from STRUCTURE_ONLY and TEMPLATE, rebinding MERGE singleton children, making dry-run consume the production import projection, and advancing the package schema to v2 with explicit legacy-v1 compatibility and fail-closed future-version handling.",
